cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RNA-seq Explorer"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, browser-based tool for exploring bulk RNA-seq differential
  expression. It provides an in-browser DESeq2-style analysis (DE, PCA, heatmap,
  scatter, pathway over-representation, and mouse CollecTRI transcription-factor
  activity) and an optional bridge to run genuine DESeq2 in R and import the
  results back so every view uses authentic DESeq2 numbers.
type: software
